From 7753365d2d8adaa8b1b380b6aa18615b2c762450 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shajmil <v.jshejmil@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 20:38:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: bundle motion check, OG link previews, single h1 on
 route pages

- check-bundle-size: read Angular-scoped @keyframes names
  (_ngcontent-%COMP%_x); allowlist the picker dialog's open animation
  (150-180ms, disabled by the global reduced-motion rule).
- Open Graph + twitter:card on all 1,252 pages, with a 1200x630 og.png
  (excluded from the service-worker precache).
- Route pages rendered two <h1>s; JourneySummary's origin is a <p> there.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KuqbjGedQe66BTnvDaDgaW
